WEBVTT

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:15.410
My right hand
holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:20.220
And my left holds
one of silver.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.350
Never one
without the other,

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:37.500
Two unseen bowls
for each of us.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:45.910
The golden one
is filled with joy,

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:53.320
shining warmly.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:58.050
Since we met,
my golden bowl

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:04.990
cannot hold all my
happiness and love.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:15.200
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:22.480
I would leave
my past behind...

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:27.280
For you, for the
sake of love,

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:34.220
I would empty the
bowls of my past.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:41.900
Based on the manga by the beloved
Ikeda Riyoko

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:57.850
Who are you?
Who are you?

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:02.850
A long time ago we
had a brief encounter..

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:05.720
Nobody else
remembers it now.

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:14.530
You were on the other side of the hedge with
a red shovel in your dirt-covered hands.

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:18.000
You spoke with brightly
beaming eyes...

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:23.740
Who are you?
Who are you?

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:31.080
Bye-bye! See you again!

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:35.080
See you again!

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:38.350
It was a rainy day,

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:41.960
A long time ago.
A brief encounter...

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:46.760
If someday, somehow, I discover that you
remember that moment,

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:51.370
On that day, I intend to confess to you
that I also remember.

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:57.110
Who are you?
Who are you?

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.990
What are you doing, Nanako?

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:10.720
You are going to be late.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:11.790
Yes...

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:14.320
Ouch!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:20.000
Don't tell me you are
going in that dress!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.870
But why not?

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:25.270
Even thought the school
does have a uniform,

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:29.340
the rules do say that it is
ok to wear regular clothes.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:33.210
...at least, as long as the
clothes are SUITABLE.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.750
Never mind that. Who in the world
would wear ordinary clothes...

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.680
to attend their high
school orientation!

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:39.220
But...

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:43.820
But...
Check with your father
before you act foollish.

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.890
That's what you always say!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.700
Good morning, Daddy.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:00.700
Nanako, that looks really good!

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.510
Now you look like a genuine
high school student.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.580
It's very cute.
It's splendid!

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:10.710
Daddy, You're always
exaggerating...

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.650
See you later!

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:19.790
<i>Brother, my
dear brother...</i>

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.800
<i>Today I started
high school.</i>

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:31.050
<i>Of course I am
not so naive</i>

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:35.340
<i>as to think it will change
my life completely!</i>

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:39.680
<i>After all, this year's cherry blossoms will
be just the same as last year's...</i>

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:44.020
<i>But... But still,
my brother...</i>

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:45.820
<i>I feel so excited...</i>

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:49.690
<i>Can you hear
my heart racing?</i>

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:56.090
<b>1. The Magnificent Ones</b>

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:00.830
We barely made it!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:02.570
Good morning, Tomoko!

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:06.240
You look so good in the uniform!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.440
You look so good in the uniform!
You too!

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.710
You were not going
to wear a uniform...

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:12.780
You weren't either!

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:15.310
You were going to wear your
favorite dress, you said.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:18.120
There is someone in my
family who is hard-headed...

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.580
Same here...

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:23.050
She is not a <i>Kiyouiku</i> Mama, but
she's still VERY conservative.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:26.790
Same here. She said, "It is common sense
to wear a uniform for your orientation."

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:27.990
What's so funny?

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.190
That is exactly
what MY mom said..

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.730
Too bad... We choose Seiran school
because they allow regular clothes.

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:34.600
But he said...

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:36.800
"Cute!"...

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:39.800
...and "Splendid"...

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:43.210
What's so funny!?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.540
Daddy's little darling!

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.080
So what?

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:54.220
<i>Brother, to tell the truth,</i>

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.160
<i>My father is not
my father by birth.</i>

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:07.170
<i>When I was five, my
mother remarried.</i>

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:13.310
[We are proceeding to City
Hall by way of Seiran School.]

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.180
[Next stop is Gouen-mae.]

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:19.780
But now... I
love my father.

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:22.180
He is kind, and intelligent...

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.860
I'm sorry....!

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:33.260
Ummm...

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:36.800
Uh...

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:49.140
<i>What a beautiful
bracelet...</i>

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:52.410
[This stop is Seiran School.]

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.550
Oh, I'm getting off here!

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.220
Please let me get off!

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.040
I'm sorry!

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.240
I'm not used to this bus yet.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.510
Here... you dropped this...

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.450
Here... you dropped this...

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:38.190
<i>When she spoke her voice
was clear like a bell,</i>

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:46.400
<i>yet also deep and soothing, like a gentle
breeze blowing through my soul.</i>

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:05.350
NOBODY is wearing a uniform!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:06.750
You're right!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.760
Let's see, I'm in section A...

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:10.620
How about you?

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:13.630
I'm in... ummm... section B.

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:14.630
That's too bad.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:19.100
We have been in the same
section since grade school.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.700
Will you miss me?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.170
A little, I guess...

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:27.170
[Please assemble in the Auditorium.]

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:29.440
[The orientation is about to begin.]

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.780
See you later!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:34.050
I'll be seeing you!

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.980
You must be an outsider.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.250
Most of the students in
uniform are from outside.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.590
None of the students from the Fuzoku
schools would be wearing a uniform.

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:47.260
Being from the outside, though,
you must really be smart.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.270
Now I'll show my secret to you!

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:56.940
I have red nail polish
on my thumb nails.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:58.940
So red! So beautiful!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:04.210
You are cute and likeable.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.350
Let's become friends!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.420
You are... I hope... in section B?

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:09.220
Yes...

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:11.820
I thought so! Me too!

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:13.150
Thank goodness!

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:15.420
My name is Shinobu
Mariko. And you?

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.360
Misonoo Nanako.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.490
An unusual name...

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:24.500
You must be using
that herbal shampoo...

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.170
I love that too!

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:30.100
Let's go. Or we'll be late!

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:38.510
Kaoru no Kimi!

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:47.650
That's Kaoru no Kimi!
<b> </b>

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:48.860
That's Kaoru no Kimi!
Look! that's Kaoru no Kimi!

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:50.520
It's really true!

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:52.530
She didn't leave after all...
<b> </b>

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:53.730
She didn't leave after all...
What a relief!

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:59.870
Udaishow Kaoru no Kimi?

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:13.880
Kaoru no Kimi-sama!
How have you been?

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:18.350
We were worried that you
might leave our school.

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:21.420
From today on, I will just
be a freshman like you.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:22.360
So, hello!

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.560
So, you intend to continue
the club activities?

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:25.830
Of course.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:28.700
Her real name is Orihara Kaoru.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:31.430
She is in our section, too.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:34.700
Let' sit down! The
orientation is starting!

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:41.440
She is a year older than us, but she was
away for a long time due to illness.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.380
You two, go on and sit down!

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:47.920
O - Ok!

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.320
<i>My brother,</i>

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.860
<i>perhaps this year's
cherry blossoms</i>

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:04.070
<i>will end up being very different from
last year's after all...</i>

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:13.880
[The class president
will now speak to us.]

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:28.420
<i>You may not believe me --</i>

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:33.360
<i>...but her lips are wet and
shining like wild berries!</i>

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.430
Look! Look at her!

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:40.440
She is Ichinomiya Fukiko. We call her
"Miya-sama". She is our queen!

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:45.710
The ladies behind her are
the Sorority members.

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:49.110
Miya-sama?
Sorority members?

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:53.050
I want so much to become
a Sorority member.

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:57.590
That has been my dream
since I came to this school.

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:59.990
I am confident I will be
selected as a candidate

00:12:00.390 --> 00:12:02.260
What is a Sorority?

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.530
It is a social group
popular in the U.S.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:09.530
New members are chosen by established
members of the Sorority

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:12.400
based on their looks,
grades, family and health.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:20.740
During your freshman year,
all of you become eligible

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:25.280
to become candidates for
entry into the Seiran Sorority.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.020
If you become a member,

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:31.150
you are invited to parties, meetings,
seminars, finishing lessons...

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:35.290
...and you are introduced
to nice boyfriends too.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:41.360
It is a ticket to a wonderful
life here at our school.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:46.570
So, those who have even the least
confidence in their looks or grades...

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:49.840
...are desperately seeking to be
noticed by the Sorority sisters.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:57.310
Soon our members will select a few
candidates who meet our standards.

00:12:57.310 --> 00:13:04.250
We will invite the candidates to
a party to finalize selection.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.990
This year the number of
candidates will be limited to ten.

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:13.200
Ten?
Only Ten!

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:35.750
The piano!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.690
It must be Saint-Juste!
Hana no Saint-Juste!

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:44.430
Saint-Juste-sama!
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:46.560
Hana no Saint-Juste-sama?

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:51.970
There are three beautiful ladies
here that everybody adores.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.910
Kaoru no Kimi,

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:57.770
Ichinomiya Fukiko-sama,

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:02.240
and Hana no Saint-Juste-sama.

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:04.510
Why don't you go see her.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.250
Go to the Music hall.

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:07.380
You should get to know her too.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:23.870
She's the one!

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:56.630
Who wants this lucky red rose?

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:20.990
I'm sorry, Tomoko!

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.130
You're late!

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:23.860
I saw her, I saw her!
<b> </b>

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:24.590
I saw her, I saw her!
What?

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:26.000
I saw Hana no Saint-Juste-sama!
<b> </b>

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:26.530
I saw Hana no Saint-Juste-sama!
What?

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:28.260
The lady I saw in the bus today.

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:30.530
She plays piano so beautifully.
<b> </b>

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:31.470
She plays piano so beautifully.
So?

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:32.670
Well, never mind...

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:45.220
That's Kaoru no Kimi.

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:46.350
Kimi?
<b> </b>

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:47.820
Kimi?
She is in my section.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:58.700
She looks very healthy...

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.430
For someone back
from a long sick leave...

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:11.440
Let's hurry up. It's going to rain.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.000
A Spring storm...

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:36.530
The cherry blossoms will
end soon, won't they...

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:39.000
Probably with this rain.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.670
The rain comes... every time...
<b> </b>

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:41.540
The rain comes... every time...
What?

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:46.940
It always rains on the
days important to me...

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:51.950
I think that's great...

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.620
I like things like that.

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:56.290
Maybe it's just in my head...

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:00.560
It didn't rain that other day...

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.290
What other day?

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:11.640
It's such a shock!

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:14.640
The Sorority will only
take ten new members!

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:17.110
That's all our class talks about.

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:23.450
The whole school seems
to be excited about it!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:24.780
Our class section seems
to talk about nothing else.

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:28.520
In our class we have daughters
of company presidents,

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.460
daughters of ambassadors,
and of politicians,

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:34.390
and daughters of professors
of prestigious colleges!

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:37.660
And there's you, the
daughter of a professor...

00:17:39.730 --> 00:17:41.800
My father would
laugh until he burst...

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:44.400
We don't really travel in
such circles, you know.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.270
So anyway, let's start thinking about
what dresses to wear to school!

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:48.870
We should!
You bet!

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:54.680
But Misaki-san - surely you would be
the  best possible candidate!

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:58.220
Your father is a famous lawyer,

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.750
and in every criteria
you are superior.

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:02.820
Well...

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:06.620
Well, it depends on
how they will judge...

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:11.700
You know her?

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:13.160
She is also in section B.

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:33.520
Saint-Juste-sama!
Hana no Saint-Juste-sama!

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:41.590
Why is she called Saint-Juste?
What's her real name?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.000
I suppose outsiders like you
wouldn't know much at all.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:51.270
She is Asaka Rei from
the sophomore class.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.870
Asaka Rei?

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.950
Miya-sama is going home.

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:16.030
I wonder if I can ever fit in here...

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:32.910
You are the one I met in the bus.

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:34.110
Yes...

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:36.520
Yes. Please use this...

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:37.520
Nanako.

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:38.780
Nanako.

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:40.920
For goodness sake, Nanako!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:43.990
What's the matter?
Are you day dreaming?

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:45.260
Let's go home!

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:47.330
The bus won't come for
another fifteen minutes!

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:48.990
And we don't have umbrellas
to walk to the station!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:50.330
You know that!

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:22.020
Another letter from that girl?

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:23.560
Yeah.

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:26.690
So, why'd you want to see me?

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:30.630
I need a break from
working on my thesis.

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:33.500
Why don't we go for a drink?

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.900
Ah, I see. Sure, fine with me.

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:46.050
Before we go, I need to go
shopping for a present.

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:47.250
Shopping?

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:49.320
I want to buy a Nyugaku-iwai.

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:52.320
Acceptance into high school?

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:53.120
Right.

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:55.520
Small world, isn't it --

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.320
her going to Seiran...

00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:58.260
Yeah...

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:02.860
Are you sending that
with your name on it?

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:04.200
I guess so.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.130
You really want to do that?

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:11.270
Then the professor and his
wife will find out who you are.

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:15.010
Even so...

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:22.620
<i>Brother...</i>

00:22:23.950 --> 00:22:26.950
<i>My dear brother,</i>

00:23:08.260 --> 00:23:12.870
<i>This is how my first day
at high school ended.</i>

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:17.610
<i>Surrounded by some beautiful upperclasswomen
and a rather worldly classmate...</i>

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:21.410
<i>It is with a sense of
wonder and bewilderment</i>

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:25.950
<i>...that I now see my Junior High years
fading forever into the past.</i>

00:23:35.820 --> 00:23:38.030
<i>What a wonderful day!</i>

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:41.100
<i>A Spring Storm!</i>

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:45.030
<i>I... couldn't imagine
anything more fabulous!</i>

00:24:09.790 --> 00:24:13.990
I dreamed I was
chasing a rainbow...

00:24:13.990 --> 00:24:19.470
Then the rainbow I
was chasing was you.

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:25.140
Before, I had no
strength, no will.

00:24:25.140 --> 00:24:30.610
But now because
of you, I do.

00:24:31.280 --> 00:24:36.820
Feelings of love,
like raindrops

00:24:36.820 --> 00:24:42.220
Come pouring
from the sky.

00:24:42.290 --> 00:24:45.030
This is surely a game

00:24:45.090 --> 00:24:47.830
Of some
mischievous fairy...

00:24:47.900 --> 00:24:50.230
Always dancing,

00:24:50.230 --> 00:24:55.440
Always capricious...

00:25:01.840 --> 00:25:03.910
As the sorority selection
day approaches,

00:25:03.910 --> 00:25:08.250
all the girls, including Shinobu Mariko and
Misaki Aya, are getting more and more nervous...

00:25:08.980 --> 00:25:10.850
On the day of selection,

00:25:10.850 --> 00:25:13.920
some of the names Miya-sama spoke
surprise everyone...

00:25:14.590 --> 00:25:17.860
How will Nanako and
Misaki-san react?...

00:25:18.790 --> 00:25:19.660
Next episode:
<b> </b>

00:25:19.660 --> 00:25:20.930
Next episode:
The Glass Slippers

00:25:22.200 --> 00:25:24.000
Brother, Dear Brother...
<b> </b>

00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:29.610
Brother, Dear Brother...
There is no end to my tears...
